illion of 364-day Treasury bills to be dated November 25, 1988, and to mature November 24, 1989. The issue was to refund $9,373 million of maturing 52-week bills and to pay down about $375 million. Tenders were opened on November 17. They totaled $28,998 million, of which $9,052","stderr":"","exit_code":0},"isError":false}}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
